{
 "__fileName__": "enUS_Text/meta/StringList/MovSubCC_D4X1_STORY_RECAP_HRZ_InGame.stl",
 "__snoID__": 2615152,
 "__type__": "StringListDefinition",
 "__typeHash__": 3672216444,
 "arStrings": [
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0001",
   "szText": "{2533-4733}We have sacrificed so much.",
   "hLabel": 1778881
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0002",
   "szText": "{7333-9833}Yet the war for Sanctuary\r\nis far from over.",
   "hLabel": 1778882
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0003",
   "szText": "{15933-20400}It started with Lilith and Inarius,\r\nthe Creators of Sanctuary.",
   "hLabel": 1778883
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0004",
   "szText": "{21533-24767}They each had their own twisted plans,",
   "hLabel": 1778884
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0005",
   "szText": "{24833-27167}Lilith most of all.",
   "hLabel": 1778885
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0006",
   "szText": "{27967-30967}I have not come to save,",
   "hLabel": 1778886
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0007",
   "szText": "{31033-32400}but to empower.",
   "hLabel": 1778887
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0008",
   "szText": "{35767-40233}Our only hope was a Wanderer\r\nwho'd been fed the demon's blood.",
   "hLabel": 1778888
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0009",
   "szText": "{42167-46067}This bond with Lilith\r\nwas the key to unraveling her plans.",
   "hLabel": 1778889
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0010",
   "szText": "{47467-49167}Others joined the cause.",
   "hLabel": 1778913
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0011",
   "szText": "{50533-54433}I, Lorath, was among them,\r\nfor better or worse.",
   "hLabel": 1778914
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0012",
   "szText": "{55367-59967}Together, we learned that Lilith wanted\r\nmore than to empower humanity.",
   "hLabel": 1778915
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0013",
   "szText": "{61367-65800}She aimed to consume her father,\r\nMephisto, the Lord of Hatred.",
   "hLabel": 1778916
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0014",
   "szText": "{66467-68633}He was being reborn in Hell.",
   "hLabel": 1778917
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0015",
   "szText": "{68700-71700}He is still weak, vulnerable.",
   "hLabel": 1778918
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0016",
   "szText": "{71767-74900}I must strike before he can resist.",
   "hLabel": 1778919
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0017",
   "szText": "{75567-78500}She hoped to claim his power\r\nfor Sanctuary,",
   "hLabel": 1778920
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0018",
   "szText": "{79133-81200}but even more for herself.",
   "hLabel": 1778921
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0019",
   "szText": "{81267-84333}Yet Mephisto had a part left to play.",
   "hLabel": 1778922
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0020",
   "szText": "{85600-88967}He sent his Herald\r\nto help the Wanderer stop Lilith -",
   "hLabel": 1778946
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0021",
   "szText": "{89033-92033}a devil's bargain\r\nwe'd hoped to avoid at all costs.",
   "hLabel": 1778947
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0022",
   "szText": "{94400-97300}We pursued Lilith without him\r\nas far as we could,",
   "hLabel": 1778948
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0023",
   "szText": "{97933-100067}into the very depths of Hell.",
   "hLabel": 1778949
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0024",
   "szText": "{100633-101767}And we paid for it...",
   "hLabel": 1778950
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0025",
   "szText": "{103600-104667}dearly.",
   "hLabel": 1778951
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0026",
   "szText": "{104733-106000}Was it enough?",
   "hLabel": 1778952
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0027",
   "szText": "{106800-111267}In the end, we had no choice\r\nbut to accept Mephisto's help.",
   "hLabel": 1778953
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0028",
   "szText": "{111333-116800}Your lives and those of all humanity",
   "hLabel": 1778954
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0029",
   "szText": "{116867-120433}depend on what you do next.",
   "hLabel": 1778955
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0030",
   "szText": "{120500-122300}Choose wisely.",
   "hLabel": 1778979
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0031",
   "szText": "{124833-126500}Mephisto wanted freedom,",
   "hLabel": 1778980
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0032",
   "szText": "{127000-129733}but Neyrelle imprisoned him\r\nin the Soulstone,",
   "hLabel": 1778981
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0033",
   "szText": "{129800-132167}denying Lilith her prize.",
   "hLabel": 1778982
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0034",
   "szText": "{132900-135133}The Wanderer struck her down.",
   "hLabel": 1778983
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0035",
   "szText": "{135200-139533}And with her last breath,\r\nshe warned us of a dire future.",
   "hLabel": 1778984
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0036",
   "szText": "{139600-144500}Without me, you would have no victory.",
   "hLabel": 1778985
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0037",
   "szText": "{145067-146300}I pray she was wrong.",
   "hLabel": 1778986
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0038",
   "szText": "{153733-155667}Neyrelle set out to prove it,",
   "hLabel": 1778987
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0039",
   "szText": "{156167-159433}determined to bury\r\nthe Lord of Hatred for good.",
   "hLabel": 1778988
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0040",
   "szText": "{160567-162733}I can't blame her for going alone,",
   "hLabel": 1779012
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0041",
   "szText": "{162800-165467}for not wanting to lose anyone else.",
   "hLabel": 1779013
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0042",
   "szText": "{165967-168367}But Mephisto's corruption soon took hold.",
   "hLabel": 1779014
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0043",
   "szText": "{168433-171533}Let go of me!",
   "hLabel": 1779015
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0044",
   "szText": "{171600-174800}You made a choice.",
   "hLabel": 1779016
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0045",
   "szText": "{175933-179867}It's lucky the Wanderer found her\r\nand helped her to endure it,",
   "hLabel": 1779017
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0046",
   "szText": "{179933-182167}just as they had endured Lilith,",
   "hLabel": 1779018
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0047",
   "szText": "{182233-185333}who yet lingered in their own veins.",
   "hLabel": 1779019
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0048",
   "szText": "{187400-190700}Together, they found\r\nwhat Neyrelle had been searching for -",
   "hLabel": 1779020
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0049",
   "szText": "{190767-192067}the tomb of Akarat,",
   "hLabel": 1779021
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0050",
   "szText": "{192933-196233}final resting place\r\nof Sanctuary's holy prophet.",
   "hLabel": 1779045
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0051",
   "szText": "{197467-200233}It was a prison Mephisto\r\nmight never have escaped,",
   "hLabel": 1779046
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0052",
   "szText": "{200867-203100}though he would not go easily.",
   "hLabel": 1779047
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0053",
   "szText": "{203167-208300}I will give you the violence you long for.",
   "hLabel": 1779048
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0054",
   "szText": "{211867-213800}The Wanderer defeated his Herald,",
   "hLabel": 1779049
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0055",
   "szText": "{214700-217833}but Mephisto himself\r\nslipped through their grasp",
   "hLabel": 1779050
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0056",
   "szText": "{217900-219833}and into a new vessel -",
   "hLabel": 1779051
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0057",
   "szText": "{220367-222133}the body of Akarat.",
   "hLabel": 1779052
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0058",
   "szText": "{223567-227467}Now the Lord of Hatred\r\nwalks Sanctuary as a false prophet,",
   "hLabel": 1779053
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0059",
   "szText": "{228400-232000}our damnation in the guise of salvation.",
   "hLabel": 1779054
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0060",
   "szText": "{232567-235067}We've no time to rest or to grieve.",
   "hLabel": 1779078
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0061",
   "szText": "{235633-238533}Duty demands we rise again...",
   "hLabel": 1779079
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "0062",
   "szText": "{240300-243300}to fight for all we have left.",
   "hLabel": 1779080
  }
 ],
 "ptMapStringTable": "0"
}
